[A#m]Malli Malli Gaallo [F#]Meghmaii,        [D#m]Theluthunnadhi
[A#m]Andham Ammaiyaithey,        Neela [F#]Undha
[A#m]Annattundhey,        [F#]Momataaley [D#m]Vadhannaye
